{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46776","headline":"荆门病中雨後书怀寄幕中知己 · 齐己","name":"荆门病中雨後书怀寄幕中知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病根翻作忆山劳，一雨聊堪浣郁陶。\n心白未能忘水月，眼青独得见秋毫。\n蝉声晚簇枝枝急，云影晴分片片高。\n还忆赤松兄弟否，别来应见鹤衣毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}